# Supermetrics — supermetrics.com → Ajustes → API Keys
# Requiere plan Enterprise o Team de Supermetrics
SUPERMETRICS_API_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# App
